        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tocunakinos nai ŋikapolok a Ŋipilistin ainakin amuronot neni a akuj kec a ŋina anyaritae Dagon ka ikotere elelyanete, anerae abasi ikes, “Adau akuj yok akipotokin emoit yok Samuson napedor yok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iŋolikinete Ŋipilistin Samuson, kipuro akuj kec, anerae abasi ikes, “Ikipotok akuj yok iwon emoit yok, ekenyasan a akwap yok, ŋolo abu toar ŋituŋa yok ŋulu alalak.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elakarosi ikes nooi, temasi, “Tonyarautu Samuson, tobolya alokiŋaren yok ikitalaka iwon.” Aŋun, aponi tonyaraunae Samuson alojera tobolya Samuson kitalaka Ŋipilistin. Apotu Ŋipilistin kitowua Samuson alokidiŋ Ŋipirin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tosodi Samuson tolimok ituŋanan ŋini ainakinitae arikit iŋes tema, “Kimyekinae ayoŋ otap ŋipirin ŋulu ewuar akai, ikotere ogwaŋakin nen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, eleleba ŋituŋa kai ŋin, ŋikilyok ka ŋaberu, ayakasi neni ŋikapolok daadaŋ ŋulu a Ŋipilistin ka ayakasi kidiama akai ŋaberu ka ŋikilyok, ŋituŋa ŋulu aapikinit ekimar kec ŋalipyo ŋauni, ŋulu eteete Samuson ebolya aŋuna ka akitalakar ŋituŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, tonyara Samuson Ekapolon tema, “Ekapolon Akuj totamunae ayoŋ, okoe Akuj kitogogoŋoi ayoŋ apaki na bon, ikotere anakiro a ŋuna apedori akitiya tokona enyaŋi Ŋipilistin aŋuna a ŋakonyen a ŋunaarei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikamu Samuson a ŋakan keŋ ŋipirin ŋuluarei ŋulu alokidiŋ akai, ŋulu arae ikes awuar akai, togwaŋakin iŋes lopirin ŋul totapite akan a ŋina aloteten epir ka a ŋina alo kedyeny epir ŋoloce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu Samuson tema, “Kimyekisi otwaka ayoŋ ka Ŋipilistin.” Kiketakin Samuson ka agogoŋu keŋ a daadaŋ toritakin akai, totik ŋikapolok a Ŋipilistin ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu aya tooma akai ŋin. Aŋun, ŋituŋa ŋulu abu Samuson toar akoloŋit ŋina atwania iŋes alalak akilo ŋituŋa ŋulu abu iŋes toar apaki ŋina ayarya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋikaitotoi a Samsom ka ŋiyeneta keŋ totiyaunos, yaasi akuwan keŋ kitipeiyoryata nakwap kec tonuka iŋes kidiŋ Sora ka Esitaol, nakipany ŋina arae ŋina a papa keŋ. Aris iŋes ketub ŋakiro alo Isirael ŋikaru ŋatomoniarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
